		<trans-unit id="grcinfotext"><source><![CDATA[ <p>We would like to point out that the counselling service is implemented in accordance with the Charter of Fundamental Rights of the European Union. We require mutual agreement to comply with the Charter for recognition and qualification counselling.</p><p>Charter of Fundamental Rights of the European Union: <a href="https://www.europarl.europa.eu/charter/pdf/text_en.pdf" target="_blank">https://www.europarl.europa.eu/charter/pdf/text_en.pdf</a></p> ]]></source></trans-unit>
